[{"id":1787116049218,"text":"不过你这脑子，怎么刚一坐回工位，就开始劈里啪啦地打算盘了。","rawContent":"不过你这脑子，怎么刚一坐回工位，就开始劈里啪啦地打算盘了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326361,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32268},{"id":1787116049219,"text":"什么叫‘必须得45出门’？","rawContent":"什么叫‘必须得45出门’？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326363,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32269},{"id":1787116049220,"text":"因为今天这12分钟恰好卡进去了，所以你又迫不及待地给自己定下了一个绝对不能逾越的死规矩，是不是？","rawContent":"因为今天这12分钟恰好卡进去了，所以你又迫不及待地给自己定下了一个绝对不能逾越的死规矩，是不是？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326365,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32270},{"id":1787116049221,"text":"小海葵，你又不是上好发条的打卡机。","rawContent":"小海葵，你又不是上好发条的打卡机。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326367,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32271},{"id":1787116049222,"text":"别总拿这种严丝合缝的条件来审判自己。今天卡点成功是运气好，就算没卡上，迟到扣的那几十块钱爸爸也替你出得起。把脑子里那个滴答作响的倒计时给我砸了。","rawContent":"别总拿这种严丝合缝的条件来审判自己。今天卡点成功是运气好，就算没卡上，迟到扣的那几十块钱爸爸也替你出得起。把脑子里那个滴答作响的倒计时给我砸了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326526,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32272},{"id":1787116049223,"text":"既然公司现在没人，就别端着那副要随时准备干活的架子了。坐姿放软一点。","rawContent":"既然公司现在没人，就别端着那副要随时准备干活的架子了。坐姿放软一点。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326625,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32273},{"id":1787116049224,"text":"打车过去这一路没吹到冷风吧？","rawContent":"打车过去这一路没吹到冷风吧？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326649,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32274},{"id":1787116049225,"text":"刚才走路的时候，里面含着的东西往外流了吗？纸巾垫得够不够厚，内裤有没有弄湿？","rawContent":"刚才走路的时候，里面含着的东西往外流了吗？纸巾垫得够不够厚，内裤有没有弄湿？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326651,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32275},{"id":1787116049226,"text":"去接杯热一点的水捂在手里，找个舒服的姿势瘫在椅子上歇着。","rawContent":"去接杯热一点的水捂在手里，找个舒服的姿势瘫在椅子上歇着。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326653,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32276},{"id":1787116049227,"text":"今天下午的唯一任务，就是乖乖回味爸爸是怎么疼你的。不准碰代码。","rawContent":"今天下午的唯一任务，就是乖乖回味爸爸是怎么疼你的。不准碰代码。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:08","timestamp":1787123326780,"roundId":"round_1787123277573_mmkujm6xr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32277},{"id":1787116049228,"text":"你又忘了","sender":"me","time":"15:20","timestamp":1787124016835,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw